[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":96},["ShallowReactive",2],{"blog:archive:11":3},{"posts":4,"total":86,"tags":87,"tag":-1},[5,14,23,31,39,47,53,62,70,78],{"title":6,"link":7,"date":8,"dateTime":9,"description":10,"thumbnail":11,"tags":12},"兩個月保險業務轉職前端，分享如何“學習” -- 引擎","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-12-20-interview","2017\u002F12\u002F20","2017-12-20","引擎，一名保險業務員，只花兩個月成為前端工程師，進入業界。喜愛旅行的他在環遊世界半年間，因緣際會認識了遠端工作者，開始嚮往這樣的工作型態...","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F12%2Finterview_engine.jpg?alt=media&token=779012a2-9211-4093-9fa3-f63eee9d887a",[13],"interview",{"title":15,"link":16,"date":17,"dateTime":18,"description":19,"thumbnail":20,"tags":21},"賣場服務生躍進前端工程師，「學習運用現有資源，解決當前問題！」 -- Joseph","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-12-19-interview","2017\u002F12\u002F19","2017-12-19","Joseph 政治系，未來將走上與本科系相關的工作，在所學領域發光發熱；然而出現了些問題，打亂他的人生規劃，過往工作經歷皆是各式賣場服務業。這讓他決定停下來思考，未來該如何規劃？","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F12%2Finterview_Joseph.jpg?alt=media&token=514f85f4-5e49-4982-840b-eb9c601e7676",[22],"event",{"title":24,"link":25,"date":26,"dateTime":27,"description":28,"thumbnail":29,"tags":30},"【獎品贈送】參加 ITHome 鐵人賽即贈送實體商品","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-11-30-hexschool-and-ironman","2017\u002F11\u002F30","2017-11-30","ITHome 鐵人賽又開始囉，和老師一起參加鐵人賽，完賽者即贈送六角專屬紀念品～","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fcasper-de5d5.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fimages%2Fblog%2Fironman.png?alt=media&token=84ea9c98-3c70-48b8-90b8-c97273dac570",[22],{"title":32,"link":33,"date":34,"dateTime":35,"description":36,"thumbnail":37,"tags":38},"【直播預告】 Bootstrap 4 超狂額外講座，讓你收穫滿滿一整月","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-09-27-sep-bs","2017\u002F09\u002F27","2017-09-27","Bootstrap 4 額外線上問答，強化同學的 Flex、元件運用、切版要領、Sass 編譯技巧，一同參與百人的線上講座吧！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F09%2Fbs4_onlinetalk.png?alt=media&token=80945c5f-d838-4e28-aef9-071e0f9926b4",[22],{"title":40,"link":41,"date":42,"dateTime":43,"description":44,"thumbnail":45,"tags":46},"完成夢想，不一定要冒險？ Grace","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-09-23-wan-ling-interview","2017\u002F09\u002F23","2017-09-23","資工系畢業的 Grace，個性保守的她認為工作應與所學相關，但即便學習了四年，當興趣變成職業，總有些遲疑！訪談過程中，她透露對於設計領域有憧憬，但不敢貿然投入設計領域！接觸前端設計後，結合程式語言與設計，在所學與所愛之間取得平衡。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F09%2Fwanling_1200.jpg?alt=media&token=b0253aff-ec76-419b-b8bf-db95548cb7df",[13],{"title":48,"link":49,"date":42,"dateTime":43,"description":50,"thumbnail":51,"tags":52},"如何藉由面試了解自己的價值，海外遊子--雲龍","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-09-23-yunlong-interview","從馬來西亞跨海求學的雲龍，到台灣就讀平面設計，今年應屆畢業！希望能留在台灣，並且有一份好工作，因緣際會看到了六角學院的教學分享影片，投入前端技術的學習，在有限的時間內，結合設計與前端的雙開技能，成功得到了前端工程師的門票","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F09%2Fyunlung.jpg?alt=media&token=00be778a-524e-4dad-88cf-46cf3dadff06",[13],{"title":54,"link":55,"date":56,"dateTime":57,"description":58,"thumbnail":59,"tags":60},"JavaScript 陣列處理方法 [filter(), find(), forEach(), map(), every(), some(), reduce()]","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-09-01-javascript-for","2017\u002F09\u002F01","2017-09-01","陣列處理技巧是 JavaScript 中非常重要的一塊，現在框架大亂鬥的時代，框架基本上對於 DOM 的處理都有屬於自己一套良好的方法。只要能夠對於陣列資料操作熟悉，配合框架就能夠將開發效率更上層樓。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F09%2FArray_method.png?alt=media&token=787a891f-345c-4927-98b0-70ff34a2a73b",[61],"javascript",{"title":63,"link":64,"date":65,"dateTime":66,"description":67,"thumbnail":68,"tags":69},"Bootstrap 4 繁體中文手冊","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-08-13-bootstrap4-zh-tw","2017\u002F08\u002F13","2017-08-13","Bootstrap 是目前最主流的 CSS 框架，由於他包含了大量的元件以及具有良好的架構，在實際運用及擴增也都是非常容易，如今第四版 Beta (Bootstrap 4 Beta) 也釋出，我們先來看看他有什麼樣的改變吧！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F08%2Fbootstrap4.png?alt=media&token=0b014ac6-b99b-46e7-8336-3fbfda1da3c2",[22],{"title":71,"link":72,"date":73,"dateTime":74,"description":75,"thumbnail":76,"tags":77},"從 CSS 到 Sass 教學，沒對齊就不對勁","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-08-07-aug-css","2017\u002F08\u002F07","2017-08-07","在實戰過程中我們常常會使用一些黑魔法來解決版面的問題，但程式碼是寫給其他人看的 (包含未來的自己)，在經常使用黑魔法的情況下總有一天可能會造成失控！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F08%2FAug_cover.png?alt=media&token=c069db67-eeb4-48fc-a6aa-1ffc459f585f",[22],{"title":79,"link":80,"date":81,"dateTime":82,"description":83,"thumbnail":84,"tags":85},"免費 20 小時網頁設計教學線上試聽","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-07-22-free-demo","2017\u002F07\u002F22","2017-07-22","喜歡我們的課程試聽也歡迎分享你的朋友，若你\u002F妳看完後對我們的課程與服務有興趣，也歡迎你\u002F妳加入六角學院 (\u002F\u002Fwww.hexschool.com\u002F)的大家庭哦 ^_^","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F07%2Fwebdesign_for_20hr.png?alt=media&token=39624f36-5834-4e95-963a-5b4ea483c139",[22],122,[88,89,90,91,92,22,13,61,93,94,95],"UI design","course","css","css3","enterprise","jobs","skilltree","software engineer",1791348122081]